  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/By49xtSDGC7gqXFkkOTZxn1AGfSuDX0uxgOv0k_9Dug.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\\(\\alpha < 2\\) and \\(\\beta > 2\\)\nLet, \\(\\mathrm{p}(\\mathrm{x})=\\mathrm{x}^2+\\mathrm{px}-\\mathrm{q}^2\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\therefore \\mathrm{p}(2) < 0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2^2+2 p-\\mathrm{q}^2 < 0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 4+2 p-\\mathrm{q}^2 < 0\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
